   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Changes the Workflow to Precise Data </h2>",
   "body": "<p>»smile« puts your production on the reliable basis of precisely recorded tool measurement data. This workflow provides the best starting conditions you can offer your CNC machines.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://myzoller.com/us/en/shop/smile420-pilot40-en\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Buy now</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://myzoller.com/us/en/expert/booking/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">1:1 expert meeting</a></p>",
