     "label": "Panel PC",
     "text": "<h3>Panel PC</h3> <h4>Panel PC</h4> <p>Panel PC with industrial-grade 24\" TFT color monitor for sharp display of tools and geometries. High computing power to analyze and evaluate the measurement data.</p>"
