     "text": "<h3>Base body</h3> <h4>Base body</h4> <p>Base body in the Z and X axes - manufactured from a light metal alloy specially developed for measuring devices. Designed to absorb the weight and forces of the tools. The guarantee for long-term stability and precision in reliable measuring processes.</p>"
