  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Ergonomics under control </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">The »eQ« (ergonomic &amp; quick) one-hand operating handle is all you need to adjust the entire appliance tower in the X and Z axes with just one hand. In addition, important functions can be assigned to the release button of the »eQ«. This makes operation even more convenient and ergonomic.</p>",
