  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Prepared for high precision </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">The SK 50 spindle accepts adapters with SK50 mounts. Due to its special features, it delivers precise results with every measurement. It has a concentricity of &lt; 2 µm, a pneumatic spindle brake, 4 x 90° spindle indexing and integrated calibration balls.</p>",
