   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">Everything about »smile« is designed for durability and continuous use. Whether for large-scale production, medium-sized companies or small-scale manufacturing - this presetting and measuring machine keeps pace with your rhythm, even right next to the CNC machine.</p>",
